# Local dev tooling: specs, the copy-review skill, and the generated
# copy-dump.txt. Shared with other sessions by sharing the folder, not through
# git. Keeping it untracked also keeps it out of the deploy, which matters
# because this is a static site served from the repo root: anything committed
# here would be publicly fetchable at /.claude/...
.claude/

# Installed by Vercel at build time from package-lock.json; never committed.
node_modules/
